  "body": "(I'm adding this mostly as a tracking bug after I [asked about it in the wrong place](https://github.com/whatwg/fetch/issues/586)) \r\n\r\nNodeJS is [looking into supporting async iterables](https://github.com/tc39/proposal-async-iteration/issues/74) as a way to stream data, and it would be great if fetch (or the readable stream part of fetch) supported the same interface. This would make easier to move code between nodejs and the browser.",
